SUMMARY:New Moon in Libra Gong Sound Immersion in the Dome
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\n**Star Sounds with David Heiss**\n**Spe
 cializing in Astrological Events and Sound Healing Journeys**\n\n🌹As Ve
 nus turns retrograde\, she begins her ancient journey inward\, symbolicall
 y descending into the underworld to recover something precious that has be
 en lost\, buried\, forgotten\, or surrendered along the way.\nIn the mythi
 c story of **Inanna's Descent**\, the goddess passes through seven gates o
 n her journey into the underworld. At each threshold\, she is asked to rem
 ove something she carries until eventually she stands completely stripped 
 of the identity and power she once knew.\nVenus retrograde invites a simil
 ar inner journey.\n**What happens when we remove the layers of who we thou
 ght we needed to be?**\nOur relationships\, desires\, values\, attractions
 \, creativity and relationship with ourselves can become mirrors during th
 is passage. Old connections may reappear. Forgotten desires may stir. Some
 thing we once valued may suddenly feel empty\, while something neglected b
 egins calling us home.\nAnd on October 10\, beneath the darkness of the **
 Libra New Moon**\, we meet Venus during this descent.\nLibra seeks relatio
 nship\, harmony and balance. Venus asks us to go deeper🌹\n**What do I t
 ruly value now?**\n\n**What does my heart desire beneath expectation?**\n\
 n**And what part of myself am I ready to reclaim?**\nA New Moon is invisib
 le in the night sky\, yet a new cycle is already being born within the dar
 kness.\nPerhaps we don't need to immediately know what comes next.\nPerhap
 s first...\n**we listen.**\nAnd within the sacred darkness of the Light Ce
 nter\, surrounded by the vibration of gongs and sound\, we will create spa
 ce to do exactly that.\nThis immersive gong sound journey offers an opport
 unity to step beyond mental noise and reconnect with a deeper inner rhythm
 . The rich vibrations of gongs\, singing bowls\, and sacred sound create s
 pace for relaxation\, insight\, and nervous system restoration.\nJoin Davi
 d Heiss for an evening of sound\, stillness\, and renewal as we explore th
 e balance between thought and feeling\, action and wisdom\, under the radi
 ant fire of Leo Season.\n**Come as you are. Leave a little lighter.**\n\nT
 his special gathering invites you into a meditative sound journey designed
  to calm the nervous system\, quiet the noise of the outer world\, and awa
 ken clarity within.\n\nThrough the immersive tones of gongs\, singing bowl
 s\, and healing frequencies\, we will create space to release mental overl
 oad\, reconnect with intuition\, and align with the changing energies of t
 his pivotal time.\nHeld in the peaceful mountain energy of the Light Cente
 r\, this experience is both grounding and expansive... an invitation to sl
 ow down\, breathe deeply\, and listen inward.\nCome as you are. **Bring a 
 yoga mat\, blanket\, pillow\, water\, and anything needed to remain comfor
 table while lying down during the sound immersion.**\n\n**The evening will
  begin with a brief astrology transmission exploring the deeper meaning of
  Venus Retrograde happens once every 584 days**\, illuminating the dance b
 etween desire and discernment\, movement and meaning\, heart and mind. We 
 will then journey into an immersive gong sound healing **In the Dome** fea
 turing several gongs\, crystal and Tibetan bowls\, and other deeply resona
 nt instruments designed to calm the mind\, awaken the spirit\, and realign
  the nervous system with the rhythms of nature and cosmos.\n\n**This will 
 be an afternoon of stillness\, wonder\, activation\, and connection beneat
 h the living sky with Sound.**\n\nGet Your ticket here: [Star Sounds](http
 s://www.starsounds.love/event-details/gong-sound-immersion-in-the-dome-wit
 h-david-heiss-2)\n\nCome ready to listen\n\nCome ready to receive\n\nCome 
 ready to remember\n\n### 👤 **About David Heiss**\n\nDavid Heiss is an *
 *Evolutionary Astrologer and Sound Alchemist** devoted to guiding others i
 nto deeper self-awareness through vibration and cosmic insight.\nSince 201
 2\, he has worked with the transformative power of **gongs and astrology**
 \, following a profound awakening that shifted his life toward a path of h
 ealing and inner discovery.\nHis work blends:\n\n* **Astrological intellig
 ence** (understanding your soul’s path)\n* **Sound immersion** (direct v
 ibrational experience)\n\nCreating a space where participants can **rememb
 er who they are on a deeper level**.\nHis intention is simple and precise:
  to help you **experience yourself more fully**.\n**Tickets: $30 in advanc
 e\; day of event $35**
